  "contentHtml": "<p>김정식 선생님의 드라이아이스 만들기 글을 보고</p><p>소화기를 구매하여 실험해보았습니다.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>소화기를 꺼내들고 하는 순간 아이들 눈에서 나오는 경이로움이 느껴졌어요.&#160;</p><p>그리고 정말로 좋아했구요.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>생성된 드라이아이스는 고무풍선에 넣어서 부피가 팽창하는걸 눈으로 보여주었구요.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>재과만에서 배운 아이디어로 실험한 내용 첨부합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv8zd42yf9by7acarrxj6u72n@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rv8zd42yf9by7acarrxj6u72n/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33223764178&amp;signature=hoMkctGJlcCL7vZcZKUeEX2rMcQ%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv8zd42yf9by7acarrxj6u72n?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2OHpkNDJ5ZjlieTdhY2FycnhqNnU3Mm4iLCJ0aWQiOiJlNjQ1ZTBlZi05ZGY2LTQxY2ItOGMxYi02MTlhMmVjNzNlMzAiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODM5NTJ9.E-o5HgOl2JL2kN9HtNvKpvbKzZueFJGJ_hdJ0FbYg3QJMQUhIbgwn3LaLLAupAcQ8p7Nq-aeS3v5UVnrm2QpqA&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/38fafe9f2392bc5eecbea2f8824c95cf562a64c1?download\" data-file-name=\"소화기로 드라이아이스 만들기.mp4\" data-file-size=\"2909641\" data-mimetype=\"video/mp4\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D154%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20221027151359&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F38fafe9f2392bc5eecbea2f882